;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Heeey!<STYLE ID="1"> Chigaya-chaaan</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Where are yooou!?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1朝.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Siiis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Come ooout!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Everyone's worried about yooou!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Heeey!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Where are you hiiiding!?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\廃屋昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\廃屋天井昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
April 7, morning―.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone, and then a whole crowd of people, were shouting all over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as I'd expected, everyone seemed to have started searching for me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I think they're probably voices calling for me.<PG>
I had cut strips from my clothes with the knife and stuffed them in my ears.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That way, I send no sound to <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, my location stays unknown.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words... I still can't move.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\地下に突然できたトンネル.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Yesterday I learned firsthand the terror of the soldiers of death under <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s control.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> or I stood up to them, they weren't opponents we could do anything about.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the same state as using Droga, <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> had said.<PG>
So I mustn't even think of resisting them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And on top of that, they can't die. We're hopelessly outmatched.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I feel bad for everyone out searching, but all I can do is hide here and let it pass.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to stay hidden here until night comes again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\廃屋天井昼.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Actually, I'd already made a plan last night.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> can hijack my five senses, but it can't read my thoughts.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Couldn't this, perhaps, be turned around and used as a way of keeping <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That is, that is―I will pretend to have gone mad.<PG>
I'll wander the settlement in a daze, letting out a stream of mutterings that cozy up to <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I can't beat </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. So everyone should surrender to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">,"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and so on.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll mumble it as if mentally worn down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the very least, through my hearing, I can let <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> hear my voice.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">And </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, for its part, must want a living human spy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s goal is probably to cover this settlement in fruiting bodies once again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That way, an ecosystem forms around the fruiting bodies, and mammals that can be made into <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="はい">embryos</STYLE> are drawn in too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's not only humans that can be made into <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="はい">embryos</STYLE>, but other wild creatures as well.<PG>
But to become an <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="はい">embryo</STYLE>, you have to use Droga or be bathed in the blood of someone who has―
{PAUSE ""}
in other words, it seems you have to become the first or second generation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I can do is let them hear the words
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Let's all become cherry trees!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
and so, quite naturally, get everyone to evacuate the settlement.<PG>
It would be effective if I could let <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> hear my act.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He would grasp its meaning at once―
{PAUSE ""}
though not, probably, whether the madness is an act―
{PAUSE ""}
and get everyone out of the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I can, I must keep my own eyes and ears from taking in that evacuation or the decision behind it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> learned that everyone was evacuating, who knows what it would do...<PG>
The problem is whether something like this can keep <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE> to the end.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So, to raise the odds of success even a little, I'll start the game of bluff right now, from this moment.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\廃屋昼内部.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I can't... I just can't... there's no getting away..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I mumbled it to myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even with the earplugs in, I could hear my own voice clearly.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What do I do... maybe I should stop resisting..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At first, I'll voice feeble complaints like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, taking my time, I'll gradually turn them into words of surrender to <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That will seem more natural than suddenly announcing I'm on its side.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, I can't let it know where I am right now.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I just... want to die..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
―And then, the presence of someone approaching this hut.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not hearing, not touch―a human presence felt on the skin.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone was coming this way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> perceive even this sense, which I could hardly call one of the five?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I covered my ears and made myself tremble.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\目を閉じる.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "111" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"No...! How am I supposed to fight that...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I closed my eyes and hid under the table.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shaking with fear and covering my ears―that's a natural thing to do.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No one can be allowed to find out where I am.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
Then I felt air moving inside the hut.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone seemed to have opened the door.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Please...! I don't want to die...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I don't want to die...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I kept on screaming, in a voice too small for even someone a meter away to hear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I pressed my hands over my ears as hard as I could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If whoever just came into the hut looks into every corner, that's it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That eerie sound will ring again, and corpses will appear where I am.<PG>
"―
{PAUSE ""}
―
{PAUSE ""}
―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I thought I heard someone's voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't even tell if it was a man or a woman, young or not.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I can do now is pray that whoever is searching doesn't find me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With just the letter and the audio I left in the storehouse, no one but <STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE> would understand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I'm found now, it's all over.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"No! No! No!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Uncle</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...! Wake up...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't want to become a cherry tree...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"At least save me...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Turn the others into cherry trees instead...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Let everyone else do the dying!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I don't want to die! Everyone else can die in my place!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Suddenly, air moved through the hut again.<PG>
And the sense of someone there was unmistakably moving away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, I didn't stop muttering.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like a sutra to drive humans away, I kept up the words of terror, on and on.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\廃屋昼.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Since I was talking while keeping track of what was around me, there was no variety to the vocabulary; I repeated the same words.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A plea of terror in a poor vocabulary―that may have been all the more real.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\廃屋天井昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Before I knew it, I had taken my hands from my ears, opened my eyes, and was gazing at the ceiling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But my mouth was still voicing terror now and then.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's probably just because talking to myself has become a bit of a habit. I'm not seriously thinking of surrendering to <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Seen from outside, would I look dazed and limp?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I've made it more realistic without meaning to...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1朝.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Now and then I sensed people far off, but none of them seemed to come this way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They seemed to have divided up the search areas properly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, the person who searched this hut earlier...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Past this hut, the steep mountain path toward Toyotake Station goes on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only one person comes to mind as best suited to heading there on foot.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The one who entered the hut just now was <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE>, without a doubt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> has sharper senses than I do, so there's no way she missed that I was here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> sense something, ignore me, and go away?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so... this is a pretty painful failure.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">What makes it painful isn't that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> found me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The usual <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> would have called out to me right away and called for help.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But this time, she sensed something and left.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What on earth did <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> pick up on?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why did <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> act differently from usual...?<PG>
Yesterday, <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> was right beside me, watching what I was doing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I dug into the past, suspected <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="11">Grandma</STYLE>, and then found the books in the attic together with her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The ones who know best what I've been doing lately are <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> sensed something and left here at once―<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
That's why being found by <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> is a painful failure.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
If I don't survive, there'll be no one left who knows that <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="11">Grandma</STYLE> is the culprit who hid the books.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At New Year's, <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> and I had a huge fight over whether <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> was the culprit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> must still want to believe <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> isn't the culprit, after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So it's possible, too, that she'd leave me here to die, and―<PG>
If that were it, she could simply have played dumb yesterday when we found the books in the attic―<STYLE ID="2">"I don't know anything."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> herself told me that if <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> was doing something bad, we'd have to stop him.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> would do something like that now...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unfortunately, the reason <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> left me here could be read either way, good or bad.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\廃屋天井昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Maybe I really should give up... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That way I wouldn't have to suffer..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I let out the muttering I'd half forgotten.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In a few hours, the Motoki-cho group will arrive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But come to think of it, the circumstances bringing the Motoki-cho group here are puzzling too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜散る.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
If they're coming here because of <STYLE ID="12">Natsumi-chan's</STYLE> danger sense, then <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> has called <STYLE ID="12">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's been on my mind since last night.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So there's one more thing I have to do tonight.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\元木町組.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
That is to confine the Motoki-cho group.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To put it more precisely, to keep the Motoki-cho group and the corpses―
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>―from coming into contact.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> is second generation, so if she comes near a third-generation corpse, her constitution would turn her into fourth generation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> were to use corpses to dig up Verde's mummy, that would truly be the end.<PG>
Second generation...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">My mom</STYLE> was second generation too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means that 10 years ago, she met the conditions for making the cherry reproduce.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If Verde's mummy were dug up, or if I died, <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> was fated to change into fourth generation.<PG>
With that, <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> would have sunk to being <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s servant, and could even have gotten everyone to use Droga in the name of danger sense.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why has <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> started moving only now, and why does it need to bring the Motoki-cho group here?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's still a lot about its aims that isn't clear...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
Let me sort this out a bit.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "太古の暗い鳴動.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\雪山.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This land has had a certain fungus rooted in it since the beginning of time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her name is <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, a kind of mushroom classed as a honey fungus.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> has traits other fungi don't.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, by its ecology, seems to have an extreme aversion to having its true nature known, and tries to kill or carry off anyone who learns it, as I did, by controlling corpses.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I just can't make out what <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> is after.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To begin with, from <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s point of view, my ending up in this situation is, in a sense, an accident.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵本乱雑.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
If I hadn't been looking things up in the storehouse's books, I wouldn't have been carried off either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So doing anything to me is probably somewhat removed from <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s goal.<PG>
I see. Now I know why <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> used those two to abduct me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was to keep everyone from finding out about <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Keep me away from everyone, and the discovery that <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> exists can be delayed.<PG>
No, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But then I can't see why <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE>, who was looking into the storehouse's books 10 years ago, is unharmed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> knew about <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> was looking into the storehouse's books, and through <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> must have known that as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet he's still unharmed, which means...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be that <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> had already sunk to being <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s spy...?<PG>
But that's only a possibility.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It really is hard to trust the people of the settlement completely, even when they're family.<PG>
Either way, one of <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s aims is the Motoki-cho group―
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
to bring them here, <STYLE ID="12">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> in particular.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though it already had <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> 10 years ago, it went to the trouble of bringing <STYLE ID="12">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> here...<PG>
Is there, perhaps, some secret about <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> that I still don't know?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What could it want to accomplish once it has brought <STYLE ID="12">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> here?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Either way, nothing good will come of it.<PG>
So what I have to do is pretend to surrender to <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, confine the Motoki-cho group, and get them out when I see an opening.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No one must see that my madness is an act.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To keep <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE>, I have to <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="だま">deceive</STYLE> everyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For that, rather than persuading them, I have to confine them by force.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">And to fool </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> further, I myself have to propose the plan of 'turning the people who came here into cherry trees.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> probably won't let anyone who has learned its true nature get away, so I'll pretend to go along with that too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, when I see an opening, I just have to get them all to escape at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I can manage to get in with <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, an opening is bound to appear somewhere.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\廃屋昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
All right. Around the time the Motoki-cho group learns of the memo and audio I left, I'll leave this hut.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Pretending to be mad, I'll approach the Motoki-cho group and confine them in this hut.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm not exactly confident a plan like this will really work, but unfortunately, this is the best my head can do.<PG>
Still... it bothers me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why did <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> summon <STYLE ID="12">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>?
